{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id414315604"}, "name":{"label":"NazZee22"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-08-27T11:56:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4682600376"}, "title":{"label":"A Top 10 App"}, "content":{"label":"Like sleep in a bottle. I have used this app both for relaxation before bed, and for finding the “zone” while working from home.\nThis app distinguishes itself from all my other white noise apps (I know, I’m weird.) with personalization, a variety of mesmerizing sounds, and an overall feel that is one of a kind.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37078527"}, "name":{"label":"turningfortune.com"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-08-27T09:58:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4682248560"}, "title":{"label":"So good it should be built in"}, "content":{"label":"Dark Noise is so easy to use and such a good citizen of iOS that it makes you feel like the iPhone should *come with* a Noise app, and this should be it. A good noise app and a pair of headphones is the best defense against insanity, and I think Dark Noise is going to keep me sane for a long time. (Don’t worry, I already lodged a request for a starship engine noise 😉)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35450457"}, "name":{"label":"bsuto"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-08-27T05:06:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4681243088"}, "title":{"label":"Indispensable"}, "content":{"label":"I rely on a white noise generator as a coping mechanism for misophonia, and this app is such a joy to use that it helps reduce anxiety even more in those situations. There are so many clever design considerations, like a layout for one-handed use, special care to mask when a sound loops, an overall app size that’s a fraction of competitor apps, and more. Thank you Charlie!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
